"""Activation of layers.1.mlp.down_proj:903: a detector for words that join or
introduce parallel items in a list.

The component is positive on coordinating conjunctions (and, or, und, y, 和),
on the copula "be", on example introducers (such as, including, like), on
opening brackets and on commas. It is strongest for a conjunction or bracket
that follows a plural noun or a comma, i.e. inside a list that is being built
