"""A string-assembly detector, strongest where literal text gives way to a value.

Recognize concatenation, interpolation, format calls, and a logging label's
following arguments. Small responses cover the surrounding string syntax.
These are syntax heuristics, not a full parser. A 500-character tail is
retained; document boundaries reset it. Other tokens are mostly zero.
